# WebGL constants (nogc_sync_mut tier).
# GL enum mirror plus WebGL-specific caps. These lived in webgl_context.spl,
# but that module imports webgl_context_objects.spl and
# webgl_context_pipeline.spl back (impl WebGLContext), and both val-import
# these constants: a val import from a still-loading module is rejected.
# They live in this import-free module; webgl_context.spl re-exports them
# via `export use` so existing import sites keep working.

